{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make it mandatory to offer late 3rd trimester pregnancy scan",
        "additional_details": "We believe this scan could help to check the health of baby, their weight, blood flow, growth etc. This could provide an opportunity for healthcare professionals to act on an early delivery if necessary, which could reduce the number of stillborns",
        "background": "We call on the Government to make it mandatory for all NHS trust to offer late 3rd trimester scans for ALL pregnant mothers including \"low risk\" pregnancies.",
